  "body": "配置 ZCode 之后，在 ZCode 里面展示的思考等乱序，需要手动在 ZCode里面手动调整\n\n这是 magpie 的配置：\n<img width=\"1141\" height=\"1370\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92d87237-7058-4912-8abb-793b74ff9f57\" />\n\n配置zcode之后选择思考强度：\n\n<img width=\"1885\" height=\"841\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/032dfba6-44c1-490d-82cb-6bae9bd9172c\" />\n\n<img width=\"930\" height=\"873\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f161e70e-8549-4f6e-a7fc-06a8ce44e52c\" />\n\n在 magpie看到的请求思考强度：\n\n<img width=\"1666\" height=\"584\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd5035f8-d513-4e9c-9054-83ca547188df\" />\n\n最后我发现需要在 ZCode 里面是乱序的，所以我手动调整：\n\n<img width=\"816\" height=\"860\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe177e64-8b24-45d9-b73e-42184af0a877\" />\n\n希望可以排查一下并修复",
